      "writtenOn": "2015-09-16T16:27:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I still don\u0027t see why do we care about the value read in line 153. We waited, the error register finally cleared, shouldn\u0027t we return a success here even if read in line 153 returned a non zero value?",
      "revId": "cab8234f0acdb0a9df771cb171f82dc95cbcba23",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
